# Cited evidence is stored byte-for-byte. The claims pack binds each artifact by
# the sha256 of the bytes the generator hashed (CRLF, written on Windows);
# normalising them to LF on commit left a clone unable to verify eight of them.
docs/evidence/artifacts/** -text
